<title>AUSTRALIA: Fairfax says director Reynolds resigns.</title>
<headline>Fairfax says director Reynolds resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newspaper publisher John Fairfax Holdings Ltd said on Thursday that David Syme and Co Ltd managing director John Reynolds had resigned to become an executive with Normandy Mining Ltd.</p>
<p>Syme, a unit of Fairfax, is the publisher of The Age daily newspaper of Melbourne and other regional publications.</p>
<p>Reynolds would leave the company on August 8, Fairfax said.</p>
<p>He joined the company from regional publishing group Australian Provincial Newspapers Ltd in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
